umber":26,"audio":[{"id":"anilibria","dubId":"AniLibria","label":"AniLibria (RU)","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":1420,"sources":[{"quality":720,"url":"https://cache-rfn.libria.fun/videos/media/ts/429/25/720/7692029c4da0006179d6229b4ec4ae54.m3u8?countryIso=KZ&isAuthorized=0&isWithVideoAds=1&isWithVideoAdsAlways=1","stream":true},{"quality":480,"url":"https://cache-rfn.libria.fun/videos/media/ts/429/25/480/c46af74bd486c8d855f3b6d0d28bdc6f.m3u8?countryIso=KZ&isAuthorized=0&isWithVideoAds=1&isWithVideoAdsAlways=1","stream":true}],"subtitles":[],"opening":{"start":1,"end":89},"ending":{"absent":true}}],"ordinal":25},{"number":27,"audio":[{"id":"anilibria","dubId":"AniLibria","label":"AniLibria (RU)","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":1420,"sources":[{"quality":720,"url":"https://cache-rfn.libria.fun/videos/media/ts/429/26/720/b24c4037ff8bc3a94f95a94dde8e04b8.m3u8?countryIso=KZ&isAuthorized=0&isWithVideoAds=1&isWithVideoAdsAlways=1","stream":true},{"quality":480,"url":"https://cache-rfn.libria.fun/videos/media/ts/429/26/480/d40588ff9ee20285b47d1d97faba27f7.m3u8?countryIso=KZ&isAuthorized=0&isWithVideoAds=1&isWithVideoAdsAlways=1","stream":true}],"subtitles":[],"opening":{"absent":true},"ending":{"absent":true}}],"ordinal":26}],"translations":{"en":["Fate/stay night: Unlimited Blade Works","Fuyuki City - a city surrounded by the sea and mountains becomes the setting for an ancient ritual. Seven masters are given control of heroic spirits in order to realize the mythical Holy Grail, which is said to grant its owner any wish. These heroic spirits or servants represent legendary heroes of various classes: \"Saber,\" \"Lancer,\" \"Archer,\" \"Rider,\" \"Caster,\" \"Assassin,\" and \"Berserker.\" Each master will enter into a contract with their chosen servant and battle the others to the death until only one pair remains... This is the \"Holy Grail War.\"\n\n\n\nThe young and capable mage, Rin Tohsaka, prepares for her long-awaited Fifth Holy Grail War to begin... With her servant Archer, Rin enters the Holy Grail War as the sole heir to the prestigious Tohsaka family after her father's death. But when Shirou Emiya, a boy from Rin's school, unwittingly becomes a Master and is fatally wounded in battle, she has no choice but to save him. With Shirou and his servant Saber, Rin sets out to strike down the conspiracies surrounding the Holy Grail War. Will the Holy Grail bless Rin and Shirou's path toward victory or will they be cursed with defeat?\n\n\n\n(Source: Aniplex of America)\n\n\n\nNotes:\n\n- Includes Prologue.\n\n- The first, second and last episodes aired with a runtime of ~48 minutes as opposed to the standard 24 minute long episode.\n\n- Based on the second route from TYPE-MOON's visual novel, Fate/stay night."],"ja":["Fate/stay night [Unlimited Blade Works]",""]},"kodikRevisions":{"serial-20177":"2019-12-11T14:47:16Z","serial-13601":"2019-12-10T13:21:35Z","serial-13600":"2019-12-10T13:21:22Z"},"kodikIds":["serial-20177","serial-13601","serial-13600"],"relatedMalIds":[11741,28701],"availableEpisodeCount":27,"rating":8.18,"relations":[{"id":11741,"relation":"prequel"},{"id":28701,"relation":"sequel"}]}]}